msgstr "Spørg ikke igen"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:239
msgid "Test mode: reports go to staging. Sharing still requires your consent."
msgstr ""
"Testtilstand: rapporter sendes til testmiljøet. Deling kræver stadig dit "
