msgstr "Din indstilling er gemt."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:242
msgid "Thank you. Your feedback was sent."
msgstr "Tak. Din feedback er sendt."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:242
msgid "Linked usage and lifecycle reports were deleted. Reporting is off."
msgstr ""
"Tilknyttede brugs- og livscyklusrapporter er slettet. Rapportering er slået "
