#: includes/product-feedback.php:242
msgid "The service could not complete the request. Please try again later."
msgstr "Tjenesten kunne ikke gennemføre anmodningen. Prøv igen senere."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:242
msgid "Please check your answers and confirm what you want to send."
msgstr "Kontrollér svarene, og bekræft, hvad du vil sende."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:244
msgid "Optional usage insights"
msgstr "Frivillige brugsstatistikker"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:245
msgid ""
"Off by default. Share a weekly usage summary and future "
"activation/deactivation events to help improve Alba Board. No card content "
"or personal contact details are included. You can stop reporting and delete "
"linked reports."
msgstr ""
"Slået fra som standard. Del en ugentlig oversigt og fremtidige "
"aktiverings-/deaktiveringshændelser for at forbedre Alba Board. Kortindhold "
"og personlige kontaktoplysninger medtages ikke. Du kan stoppe rapportering "
"og slette tilknyttede rapporter."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:246
msgid "What is shared and how it is handled"
msgstr "Hvad der deles, og hvordan det behandles"

#: includes/product-feedback.php:247
msgid ""
"Off by default. With your permission, Alba Board reports when sharing is "
"enabled or disabled and future plugin activations/deactivations, and sends a"
" small weekly summary to the Alba Board reporting service: software "
"versions, the selected Alba theme, approximate board/card/member counts, and"
" feature activity ranges since opting in. No card content, names, emails, "
"files, site URL, or unrelated plugin inventory is included. A random "
"installation ID links summaries; this is pseudonymous, not anonymous."
msgstr ""
"Slået fra som standard. Med din tilladelse rapporterer Alba Board, når "
"deling slås til eller fra, samt fremtidige "
"pluginaktiveringer/-deaktiveringer. En lille ugentlig oversigt sendes til "
"rapporteringstjenesten: softwareversioner, valgt Alba-tema, omtrentlige "
"antal tavler/kort/medlemmer og intervaller for funktionsaktivitet siden "
"samtykket. Kortindhold, navne, e-mails, filer, webstedets URL og andre "
"pluginoplysninger medtages ikke. Et tilfældigt installations-ID forbinder "
"oversigterne; data er pseudonyme, ikke anonyme."

#: includes/product-feedback.php:249
msgid ""
"Usage and activation/deactivation reports are retained for 90 days by the "
"updated receiver. Turning reporting off sends a final reporting-disabled "
"event and stops future sends. Lifecycle events include a random event ID, "
"plugin version, and the server receipt date; no earlier activations are "
"backfilled. Delivery is best effort, and missing reports do not prove "
"deactivation. Network-wide lifecycle tracking is not supported. You can "
"separately delete linked reports. Hosting services may retain network logs. "
"Only enable this if you are authorized to share site usage statistics."
msgstr ""
"Den opdaterede modtager gemmer brugs- og aktiverings-/deaktiveringsrapporter"
" i 90 dage. Deaktivering sender en sidste hændelse og stopper fremtidige "
"afsendelser. Livscyklushændelser indeholder et tilfældigt hændelses-ID, "
"pluginversion og modtagelsesdato; tidligere aktiveringer tilføjes ikke. "
"Levering sker efter bedste evne, og manglende rapporter beviser ikke "
"deaktivering. Netværksdækkende livscyklussporing understøttes ikke. Du kan "
"slette tilknyttede rapporter særskilt. Hostingudbydere kan gemme "
"netværkslogfiler. Aktivér kun dette, hvis du må dele webstedets "
"brugsstatistik."

